# Units `invictus-sys service enable|disable|restart` may change (design
# 4.1). One per line, then why. Things a person or Moneta has a reason to
# turn on, off or restart; nothing that guards the machine (the update
# timer, the boot guard, snapper, polkit, sshd) is here. Adding a unit is a
# line here with a reason; tests/pkgs/sys.sh checks none of the guards is.
bluetooth.service               Bluetooth on or off
cups.service                    printing
avahi-daemon.service            finding printers and scanners on the network
NetworkManager.service          restart when the network is stuck
power-profiles-daemon.service   power modes
fwupd.service                   firmware updates
invictus-extras.service         retry the extras the installer could not install
